 and glide)\n\nPhysics -\nQuick tp\nclick tackle aimbot\nanti jam (broken)\nanti block\nvisualize ball path\nno Jump cooldown\nbighead\nno freeze\nOptimal jump (dive,jump)\nno ball trail\nanti oob\ncframe speed\ntackle reach\n\nThrowing/Quarterback -\nQB Aimbot (trash,but if u have a good config then op,i recommend -1.99 x offset and -0.75 y offset)\nVisualize Esp\nAutoAngle (good af)\nAnti OOB (don't throw it out of bounds)\n95 power mode (meh)\nAuto throw type (decent)\nx offset\ny offset\nDive,dime,mag,jump,bullet\nadjust power gui (itll increase or lower the power wheel for you,making it more legit for hiding the sploits)\nTrajectory (shows where the ball will land if you're throwing it without qb aimbot)\n\nVisuals -\nCamera zoom\nNoRender\nSilentMode (hides the arraylist and bleachhack text in the corner)\n\nAutomatics -\nAutoQB\nAutoCaptain\nAutoCatch\nAutoSwat\nAutoKick\nAutoRush\nAutoBoost\nAutoGuard\n\nPlayer -\nJumppower\nSpeed (broken,i think)\nAngleEnhancer\nReplicationLag\n\nConfigs-\nSave\nLoad\n\nIf you're having any problems,dm me in discord (woops.cc) or reply to this.\nYes,the script is free.\nIt might or may not be solara supported.\nIt might not work for synapse z due to their shitty hookmetamethod.\nWorks for MOST Android executors.","tags":["football fusion","free","op","qb aimbot","mags"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766","username":"woops","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24468b7e5c4fdd7a476a59ae6ae33e15a935ffcc03b3d1fe7785cf86e1b2323f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766-1763165632270.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24468b7e5c4fdd7a476a59ae6ae33e15a935ffcc03b3d1fe7785cf86e1b2323f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766-1763165632270.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"dis